    },
    "body": "Adds optional MON/workbench tools above frozen STR8N-F v0.3.0 BASE1/PR05. MON A/B g8 provides Dump/Modify, guarded force writes, bank prompts, TIME and recovery return. Services g4, WB2 g5 and PROGRAM/SP1 add maps/wear, board-loaded CLOCK/MAINT, flash/PROGRAM Table/Store/AUTO/Restore, compatible APPS and bounded BATCH. The MAINT LOAD option is consumed before dispatching bare MAINT.\n\nValidation:\n- 2609/65C816 emulation: physical MON B boot and installed CLOCK, forced reload, maps/wear, APPS inventory, Table and bounded BATCH passed. The later positive SS1 PROGRAM trial passed Store/AUTO, same-name versions, full-directory refusal, exact Restore, run/public-HOLD return and CRC refusal before copying RAM.\n- That PROGRAM trial restored all 131072 SRAM bytes, all flash hashes and owner RAM/ZP; boot settings/history were unchanged. Two host-only handshake/acknowledgement errors and preserving continuations are retained in the acceptance evidence. Zero flash/journal/WORKSPACE/RTC-setting writes or power cuts.\n- 2512/65C02 retains earlier monitor acceptance and positive PROGRAM/APPS RAM evidence with services g3. Current services g4 on 65C02 is not yet retested; 816 flash AP/02 owner-app launch is not claimed.\n- The original five-sector install and separate D/E repair total seven erases, zero F writes/C erases; old D is archived and all pre-repair C records retained. RTC/NTP admission and historical samples remain intact.\n- Published preview 1 extraction passed manifests, frozen F, terminal dependencies/help and ZIP checks. It includes the original Python terminal and unchanged foundation kit. Later PROGRAM evidence applies to the same binaries and does not replace those published archives.\n\nASM/DBG is deferred follow-on work and does not block the current scoped MON/tools release. The imported source is reference-only; the port is not execution-qualified. Full b35 parity, advanced CLOCK/FLASH/CONFIG and full BATCH coverage remain open. Published F, release tags and existing downloads stay unchanged.\n\nManual: docs/MON_FEATURE_PREVIEW.md\nInstalled acceptance: docs/2609_MON_FEATURE_ACCEPTANCE.md\nPositive PROGRAM: docs/2609_PROGRAM_POSITIVE_ACCEPTANCE.md\nRelease scope: docs/FOUNDATION_RELEASE_PATH.md",
